# 62. Failure Handling

Internal APIs can fail.

The extension should eventually handle:

```text
401 / unauthenticated
403 / forbidden
404 / endpoint changed
429 / rate limited
5xx / server failure
network offline
malformed response
partial sync
```

A failed sync should **not delete existing local history**.

Preferred behavior:

```text
existing local database
+
successful new records
```

rather than:

```text
clear everything
→ fetch
→ API fails
→ user now has no data
```

Use transactional/update-safe synchronization.

