The dashboard should **never wait for a complete historical crawl before rendering**.

Preferred UX:

```text
Scaler dashboard loads
    ↓
cached contribution graph appears immediately
    ↓
background sync starts
    ↓
new data merged
    ↓
graph updates
```

Not:

```text
dashboard loads
    ↓
2,000 API requests
    ↓
user waits
    ↓
graph finally appears
```

Cache-first rendering is essential.

