# 71. Core Discovery in One Sentence

**Scaler stores and exposes historical per-problem user submissions containing exact `created_at` timestamps and result statuses, which means Scaler++ can potentially reconstruct a student's historical problem-solving activity from before the extension was installed and use it to generate a GitHub-style contribution calendar.**

